  "info": {
    "title": "Hip-Hop Boom Bap",
    "author": "Atomik Rack factory",
    "notes": "A laid-back boom-bap beat in A minor at 88 BPM: a warm, crushed drum kit with the kick on its own track, a round sub that ducks from the kick, jazzy seventh chords, a mallet hook and a dusty texture, with a small room and a tape echo. The verses have no lead: write a melody or a vocal there. Mute the kick track to hear the bass breathe back in, and launch scenes from the launcher to try the loops in a different order."
  },
